'''Gardulla the Hutt's Palace''' was a palace located on [[Nal Hutta]], the [[Hutt]] [[homeworld]]. The palace was owned by [[Gardulla Besadii the Elder]], a member of the [[Grand Hutt Council]]. The palace was temporarily used to imprison [[Ziro Desilijic Tiure|Ziro]], a Hutt [[crime lord]] who held damaging information about the Hutt Council.<ref name="Hunt for Ziro" /> It was guarded by many [[Nikto]] guards and other people hired to guard it. Later, it was attacked by [[Pre Vizsla]], [[Maul]], [[Savage Opress]], and some other [[Death Watch]] warriors. All the denizens of the palace were either killed or escaped. Most of the Nikto guards were killed in the ensuing battle.<ref name="Eminence">{{TCW|Eminence (episode)}}</ref>

==Description==
The palace of the [[Hutt]] [[crime lord]] [[Gardulla Besadii the Elder]] was one of the largest buildings constructed on the [[swamp]] [[planet]] [[Nal Hutta]]. It was built into the supporting stone and organic matter of what resembled a giant [[Fungus|fungal]] pod built within sight of the planet's [[capital]] [[city]] and foremost [[spaceport]], [[Bilbousa]]. Reachable by [[Starship|spacecraft]] or [[Pongeeta-class swamp speeder|swamp speeder]], the palace and its surrounding complex were heavily fortified and defended and served as the occasional home of the [[Grand Hutt Council]], the ruling body of the [[Hutt Clan]] that controlled Nal Hutta. As such, it received higher than average traffic than most palaces on the planet, which generally had few visitors due to most offworld business being conducted on the [[moon]] [[Nar Shaddaa]].<ref name="BtMF">[[Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon 81|''Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon'' 81]]</ref>

